# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

~> **`filters` is write-only.** KAS accepts filters under the names
`allinkl_mail_filters` lists, but reports the active ones under different
names, which `spam_filters` shows. A filter changed in the KAS panel is
therefore not detected as drift; the next change to `filters` sets the
whole list again.

